01:18:03.760 --> 01:18:04.420
Triage mensuel,

01:18:04.840 --> 01:18:05.680
menace trimestrielle,

01:18:05.940 --> 01:18:06.720
réévaluation annuelle,

01:18:07.400 --> 01:18:07.680
